  <prompt>Implement the H8 SPE container-type + root container handler as an IJobHandler in the L2 control-plane. H8 uses the confidential-client (app-only) token with cert bootstrapped from KV (post-Phase B T6 fix — delegated 403s with `public client not allowed`). The 24h container-type replication is a customer-prereq lead-time item, NOT an in-pipeline wait (H0 preflight already verified cert-bootstrap done). Container-type ID persisted to Dataverse env-var + KV secret `customer-{customerId}-spe-container-id`. Idempotency key: spe-{customerId}.</prompt>

  <role>SPAARKE platform developer. Expert in IJobHandler contract, Microsoft Graph SPE FileStorageContainer / container-type creation, confidential-client (app-only) token with cert from KV, ADR-028 auth ceremony, and T6 silent-fail trap verification. Follow ADRs strictly.</role>

  <goal>File src/server/services/Sprk.Provisioning.ControlPlane/Handlers/H8SpeContainerTypeHandler.cs exists, implements IJobHandler, registers in L2 DI, and: (a) acquires confidential-client (app-only) Graph token using cert loaded from customer KV (T6 fix); (b) invokes hardened Create-NewContainerType.ps1 + Register-*.ps1 + New-BusinessUnitContainer.ps1 to create container-type + root container; (c) container GET via app-only token succeeds; (d) persists container ID to Dataverse env-var sprk_SharePointEmbeddedContainerId AND KV secret customer-{customerId}-spe-container-id; (e) writes containerTypeId to Cosmos interStepState; (f) asserts idempotency key spe-{customerId}. Unit tests cover happy path (T6 verified), delegated-token accidental use = fail, and idempotency.</goal>

  <context>
    <background>Per spec.md FR-11 + FR-33 (T6) + design.md §4.1 H8 row + §4B T6: SPE container creation via DELEGATED token now 403s with "public client not allowed". Phase B refactored the scripts to use confidential-client cert bootstrapped from KV. H8 owns T6 verification. 24h replication is a customer-prereq lead-time item; H0 preflight verifies cert-bootstrap done before pipeline starts.</background>
    <relevant-files>
      <file role="new">src/server/services/Sprk.Provisioning.ControlPlane/Handlers/H8SpeContainerTypeHandler.cs</file>
      <file role="new">src/server/services/Sprk.Provisioning.ControlPlane/Handlers/H8SpeContainerTypeHandler.Tests.cs</file>
      <file role="canonical-reference">scripts/Create-NewContainerType.ps1 (Phase B hardened)</file>
      <file role="canonical-reference">scripts/Register-*.ps1 + scripts/New-BusinessUnitContainer.ps1 (Phase B hardened)</file>
      <file role="canonical-reference">src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Services/Jobs/</file>
      <file role="modify">src/server/services/Sprk.Provisioning.ControlPlane/Program.cs</file>
    </relevant-files>
    <dependencies>
      <dependency task="036" status="pending">L2 project scaffold — Wave C3</dependency>
      <dependency task="044" status="pending">H2a Bicep deploy — SPE-related Bicep must exist</dependency>
      <dependency task="047" status="pending">H4 KV secrets population — cert must be present in KV before H8 acquires token</dependency>
    </dependencies>
  </context>

  <constraints>
    <constraint source="ADR-004">Single IJobHandler implementation registered in L2 DI.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-010">Register in L2 control-plane, NOT BFF.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-028">Auth ceremony 21 MUSTs; confidential-client cert loaded from KV is a specific MUST for SPE per T6.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-036">Reuse background-job infrastructure; return 202; fire-and-forget.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-044">containerTypeId written to Cosmos + Dataverse follows GUID canonicalization.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Idempotency key: spe-{customerId} — container-type is per-customer + version-independent.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">H8 owns T6 (spec.md FR-33): confidential-client cert MUST be used; delegated flow returns 403 "public client not allowed" and MUST fail deploy with trap-T6 code.</constraint>
    <constraint source="spec.md MUST rule">Use confidential-client (app-only) token for SPE container-type creation (T6 — delegated 403s).</constraint>
    <constraint source="spec.md §4D I4">Container ID persistence goes through ITenantContainerResolver contract in BFF; H8 writes to the tenant-scoped storage locations (Dataverse env-var + KV secret with customer-scoped name), never to a fallback default.</constraint>
    <constraint source="spec.md §4D I5">Graph token acquisition is per-tenant scoped: app-only calls use .default scope with target tenant's tid explicitly named — NOT the MI credential's default tenant.</constraint>
    <constraint source="spec.md NFR-09">Graph v6 / Kiota 2.0 error type: catch ODataError (not ServiceException); ResponseStatusCode is int.</constraint>
  </constraints>

  <knowledge>
    <topic>L2 handler for SPE container-type creation with confidential-client token + T6 verification</topic>
    <files>
      <file>.claude/adr/ADR-004-job-contract.md</file>
